# Walkthrough - UPBus Live Map View

Humne admin panel par bina Google Maps ka use kiye, ek dynamic interactive **Dark-Themed Map View** add kiya hai. Is se aap poore UP bus network ke routes, stops, aur live running buses ko real-time coordinate updates ke sath visually track kar sakte hain.

## What Was Added/Modified

1. **Backend Route (`/api/v1/admin/monitor/map-data`)**:
   - Added in [admin.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/api/admin.ts).
   - Generates and exposes the list of all geocoded stops and route polyline paths from the in-memory graph.
   
2. **Leaflet CSS Dependency**:
   - Added standard Leaflet stylesheet dynamically in [layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/admin/src/app/layout.tsx).

3. **Leaflet React Map Component**:
   - Created [LiveMap.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/admin/src/components/LiveMap.tsx).
   - Renders a CartoDB Dark Matter tile base map.
   - Removed active bus circles and stop markers to keep the map focused entirely on routes.
   - Draws all learned route segments as orange polyline paths (`weight: 2.5`).
   - Dynamic Tooltips: Hovering over any route segment opens a sticky tooltip displaying the official route name (e.g., "Lucknow - Gorakhpur Express").
   - Highlight Hover Effect: Hovering over a route changes its color to neon-green (`#10b981`), increases its thickness, and increases opacity for a premium interactive feel.
   - Cleaned up Next.js lifecycle to prevent strict-mode leaflet errors.

4. **Toggle Tabs & Client Integration**:
   - Integrated in [page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/admin/src/app/page.tsx).
   - Created a header switch: **Console View** (traditional logs & search table) and **Map View** (Leaflet Map).
   - Loaded the `LiveMap` dynamically (`ssr: false`) to comply with Next.js Server Components.

---

## Verification & Usage Instructions

1. **Open the Admin Console**:
   - Open your browser at `http://localhost:3003`.
   - By default, you will see the **Console View** showing live logs and the paginated search table (which works exactly as before).

2. **Toggle to Map View**:
   - Click the **Map View** tab in the top header.
   - The interactive dark-mode map centered on Uttar Pradesh will load.
   - You will see glowing nodes for stops, orange lines representing the bus routes, and green/red indicators for moving/stationary buses.
   - Hover or click on any bus marker to view its live telemetry (Registration No, speed, closest stop, status).
